The size is 3.
The spread is 2.
The low is 1.
The high is size.
The answer is an empty list of whole numbers.
For every step from 0 to spread minus 1.
If step modulo 2 is 0, Place low into answer, add 1 to low.
If step modulo 2 is 1, Place high into answer, subtract 1 from high.

If spread modulo 2 is 0.
Repeat while low is at most high.
Place low into answer.
Add 1 to low.

If spread modulo 2 is 1.
Repeat while low is at most high.
Place high into answer.
Subtract 1 from high.

The line is empty text.
For each value in answer.
If the length of line is more than 0, Place "," into line.
Place format whole number value as text into line.

Show line.
